        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevator Pitch is a corporate parody JRPG where surviving the office requires more than good ideas. Battle your way through six floors of increasingly unhinged coworkers — clerks, HR reps, auditors, and board members who all want you gone. Build your team, level up your party, and fight your way to the corner office one turn at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a real-time turn order combat system, front and back row tactics, unlockable skills, and a cast of characters who are just as tired of this job as you are. Maya, your reluctant coworker and the only person who actually knows what's going on, will keep you alive. Probably.</p>",
